WEBVTT

00:04:58.491 --> 00:05:01.417
and it doesn't matter
how big a brain you have.

00:05:01.441 --> 00:05:04.033
Your nervous system
is just experiencing that

00:05:04.057 --> 00:05:06.022
as a kind of bombardment.

00:05:06.046 --> 00:05:10.160
CA: So I read that in your book,
where you said that often,

00:05:10.184 --> 00:05:12.357
the key marker for an introvert child

00:05:12.381 --> 00:05:16.553
is one who reacts
more strongly to stimulation.

00:05:16.577 --> 00:05:17.739
SC: Mm-hmm.

00:05:17.763 --> 00:05:20.274
CA: What kind of child
were you, for example?

00:05:20.298 --> 00:05:21.578
SC: Oh, gosh.

00:05:21.602 --> 00:05:26.106
Well, I think as a child
I was really similar

00:05:26.130 --> 00:05:27.933
to the way I am now,

00:05:27.957 --> 00:05:34.207
which is, I really liked people
and I always made friends pretty easily,